```plaintext
1result.sql
```

Reason: `1result.sql` only counts crashes that occurred between the user’s September‑2018 first‑open date and the uninstall date, guaranteeing the crash happened inside the 0‑7‑day window being analysed.  
`2result.sql` allows any crash on or before the uninstall date (even one that happened before the September first‑open), so it can wrongly credit crashes from an earlier install.